un-prompt configured. The mechanism *should* work — same prompt-composition pathway — but we shouldn't claim it's verified.\n\n## 3. Calls plugin/skill on review — verified\n\nEmpirically confirmed in the parallel smoke test: codex's output literally says *\"Using `code-reviewer` for a findings-first review of the branch diff and working tree\"*. Codex loaded the user's installed skill from `~/.codex/skills/code-reviewer/SKILL.md` when it saw `/review` in the prompt. This works.\n\n`★ Insight ─────────────────────────────────────`\nThe honest gap is #2. The PR's confidence in \"user customization works\" rests on:\n- The prompt composer puts AlwaysPrompt/PerRunPrompt into the stdin payload (verified by unit tests)\n- Codex honors custom context after `/review` (verified by the TEST_MARKER probe)\n- **But the end-to-end path with real customization set wasn't run.** That's a real assumption stack, and one a careful reviewer should poke at.\n`─────────────────────────────────────────────────`"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":532931,"cache_read_input_tokens":21199,"output_tokens":3786,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":532931,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":3786,"cache_read_input_tokens":21199,"cache_creation_input_tokens":532931,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":532931},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":{"cache_miss_reason":{"type":"previous_message_not_found"}}},"requestId":"req_011Cb2e7av9vgb94UKNnK62C","type":"assistant","uuid":"754d3546-933b-4184-946e-f1f96a38431c","timestamp":"2026-05-14T14:45:45.296Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli/.worktrees/review-fix-2","sessionId":"c91